WEBVTT

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.540
That's why people
often confuse me with a GPS.

00:01:31.564 --> 00:01:35.438
(Laughter)

00:01:36.034 --> 00:01:39.981
This can make basic communication
a challenge, unless you need directions.

00:01:40.005 --> 00:01:44.420
(Laughter)

00:01:44.444 --> 00:01:45.618
Thank you.

00:01:45.642 --> 00:01:49.869
(Applause)

00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:53.839
A few years ago, when I started
doing presentations,

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:56.492
I went to get head shots done
for the first time.

00:01:57.381 --> 00:02:00.124
The photographer told me to look flirty.